{
  "video_id": "1kFV1Td2BQs",
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kFV1Td2BQs",
  "title": "If You Don't Understand the Petrodollar, You Don't Understand Geopolitics",
  "channel": "Lock Stock Finance",
  "total_snippets": 218,
  "duration_seconds": 479.92,
  "transcript": [
    {
      "text": "Did you know that there's a system",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "running the world controlling everything",
      "start": 1.68,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "from prices to energy to government",
      "start": 3.96,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 7.8
    },
    {
      "text": "policy?",
      "start": 6.32,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 10.68
    },
    {
      "text": "And no, it's not the banking system.",
      "start": 7.8,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 12.45
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not the stock market.",
      "start": 10.68,
      "duration": 1.88,
      "end": 12.56
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [music]",
      "start": 12.45,
      "duration": 1.83,
      "end": 14.28
    },
    {
      "text": ">> It's the petrodollar.",
      "start": 12.56,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 16.64
    },
    {
      "text": "For over 50 years, it's been shaping our",
      "start": 14.28,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "end": 19.2
    },
    {
      "text": "world.",
      "start": 16.64,
      "duration": 2.56,
      "end": 19.2
    },
    {
      "text": "So, what is the petrodollar?",
      "start": 25.44,
      "duration": 6.72,
      "end": 32.16
    },
    {
      "text": "To understand the petrodollar, we first",
      "start": 29.72,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 33.84
    },
    {
      "text": "need to understand why oil is so",
      "start": 32.16,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "end": 35.36
    },
    {
      "text": "important.",
      "start": 33.84,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 38.44
    },
    {
      "text": "We use oil to fuel our cars, planes, and",
      "start": 35.36,
      "duration": 6.28,
      "end": 41.64
    },
    {
      "text": "ships to transport people and goods",
      "start": 38.44,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 43.24
    },
    {
      "text": "around our countries and around the",
      "start": 41.64,
      "duration": 2.72,
      "end": 44.36
    },
    {
      "text": "globe.",
      "start": 43.24,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 46.88
    },
    {
      "text": "We use it to make plastics. In some",
      "start": 44.36,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 48.96
    },
    {
      "text": "countries, we use it to produce",
      "start": 46.88,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 50.52
    },
    {
      "text": "electricity.",
      "start": 48.96,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 53.44
    },
    {
      "text": "We even use it to manufacture chemicals,",
      "start": 50.52,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "end": 55.92
    },
    {
      "text": "fertilizers, and many other everyday",
      "start": 53.44,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 57.2
    },
    {
      "text": "products.",
      "start": 55.92,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 59.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Our modern economy depends on oil for",
      "start": 57.2,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 62.16
    },
    {
      "text": "basically everything. Because oil is so",
      "start": 59.68,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 64.56
    },
    {
      "text": "important, countries are constantly",
      "start": 62.16,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 66.96
    },
    {
      "text": "buying and selling it. Some countries",
      "start": 64.56,
      "duration": 5.36,
      "end": 69.92
    },
    {
      "text": "produce a lot of oil, like Saudi Arabia.",
      "start": 66.96,
      "duration": 5.84,
      "end": 72.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Others use a lot but don't produce much,",
      "start": 69.92,
      "duration": 5.52,
      "end": 75.44
    },
    {
      "text": "like Japan. This creates a massive",
      "start": 72.8,
      "duration": 5.28,
      "end": 78.08
    },
    {
      "text": "global oil market. So,",
      "start": 75.44,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "end": 80.64
    },
    {
      "text": "how did the US dollar come to control",
      "start": 78.08,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 82.52
    },
    {
      "text": "this global market?",
      "start": 80.64,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 85.24
    },
    {
      "text": "To understand this, we need to go back",
      "start": 82.52,
      "duration": 5.68,
      "end": 88.2
    },
    {
      "text": "to World War II.",
      "start": 85.24,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "end": 88.2
    },
    {
      "text": "At the end of the war, while most of the",
      "start": 89.8,
      "duration": 5.28,
      "end": 95.08
    },
    {
      "text": "world lay in ruins, the US emerged with",
      "start": 92.08,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 97.08
    },
    {
      "text": "its economy and manufacturing base",
      "start": 95.08,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 98.48
    },
    {
      "text": "intact.",
      "start": 97.08,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 100.48
    },
    {
      "text": "This led to countries agreeing to make",
      "start": 98.48,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 103.24
    },
    {
      "text": "the US dollar the center of the global",
      "start": 100.48,
      "duration": 5.16,
      "end": 105.64
    },
    {
      "text": "financial system at the Bretton Woods",
      "start": 103.24,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "end": 108.32
    },
    {
      "text": "conference of 1944.",
      "start": 105.64,
      "duration": 5.48,
      "end": 111.12
    },
    {
      "text": "This would be a new world order backed",
      "start": 108.32,
      "duration": 5.24,
      "end": 113.56
    },
    {
      "text": "by the US dollar.",
      "start": 111.12,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 115.48
    },
    {
      "text": "The US promised that its dollars could",
      "start": 113.56,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 117.96
    },
    {
      "text": "be exchanged for gold, and so other",
      "start": 115.48,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 119.92
    },
    {
      "text": "currencies tied their currencies to the",
      "start": 117.96,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "end": 121.0
    },
    {
      "text": "dollar.",
      "start": 119.92,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 123.44
    },
    {
      "text": "But in 1971,",
      "start": 121.0,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 125.64
    },
    {
      "text": "President Nixon decoupled the US economy",
      "start": 123.44,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 127.52
    },
    {
      "text": "from the gold standard.",
      "start": 125.64,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 130.24
    },
    {
      "text": "This was known as the Nixon shock.",
      "start": 127.52,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 132.28
    },
    {
      "text": "This transitioned the world into a fiat",
      "start": 130.24,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 134.48
    },
    {
      "text": "currency economy, rather than a gold",
      "start": 132.28,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 135.92
    },
    {
      "text": "backed economy.",
      "start": 134.48,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 138.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Fiat currency is government issued money",
      "start": 135.92,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 140.56
    },
    {
      "text": "that isn't backed by a physical",
      "start": 138.92,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 143.2
    },
    {
      "text": "commodity like gold or silver. And",
      "start": 140.56,
      "duration": 5.64,
      "end": 146.2
    },
    {
      "text": "instead gets its value from public trust",
      "start": 143.2,
      "duration": 5.44,
      "end": 148.64
    },
    {
      "text": "and economic stability.",
      "start": 146.2,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 150.32
    },
    {
      "text": "After the US stopped backing dollars",
      "start": 148.64,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 152.88
    },
    {
      "text": "with gold, the dollar stayed dominant",
      "start": 150.32,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "end": 155.24
    },
    {
      "text": "because the US economy was so huge.",
      "start": 152.88,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "end": 155.72
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [music]",
      "start": 155.24,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "end": 157.64
    },
    {
      "text": ">> And the US government was considered to",
      "start": 155.72,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 160.48
    },
    {
      "text": "be stable. Also, many global",
      "start": 157.64,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 162.24
    },
    {
      "text": "transactions were already done in",
      "start": 160.48,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 163.8
    },
    {
      "text": "dollars.",
      "start": 162.24,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 166.6
    },
    {
      "text": "So, the dollar became what's called the",
      "start": 163.8,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 168.84
    },
    {
      "text": "world's reserve currency, meaning",
      "start": 166.6,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 170.64
    },
    {
      "text": "countries hold large amounts of it in",
      "start": 168.84,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 172.84
    },
    {
      "text": "their central banks.",
      "start": 170.64,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 174.04
    },
    {
      "text": "But",
      "start": 172.84,
      "duration": 2.7,
      "end": 175.54
    },
    {
      "text": "in 1973,",
      "start": 174.04,
      "duration": 1.8,
      "end": 175.84
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [music]",
      "start": 175.54,
      "duration": 2.34,
      "end": 177.88
    },
    {
      "text": ">> the world experienced the OPEC oil",
      "start": 175.84,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 179.28
    },
    {
      "text": "crisis.",
      "start": 177.88,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "end": 181.08
    },
    {
      "text": "This was when Arab oil producing",
      "start": 179.28,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 182.96
    },
    {
      "text": "countries stopped selling oil to",
      "start": 181.08,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 185.48
    },
    {
      "text": "countries supporting Israel in the Yom",
      "start": 182.96,
      "duration": 5.92,
      "end": 188.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Kippur War, including the United States,",
      "start": 185.48,
      "duration": 6.24,
      "end": 191.72
    },
    {
      "text": "in order to gain political leverage.",
      "start": 188.88,
      "duration": 5.72,
      "end": 194.6
    },
    {
      "text": "This caused oil prices to quadruple,",
      "start": 191.72,
      "duration": 5.72,
      "end": 197.44
    },
    {
      "text": "leading to massive shortages and severe",
      "start": 194.6,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "end": 200.0
    },
    {
      "text": "inflation in Western economies.",
      "start": 197.44,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 201.68
    },
    {
      "text": "In response to this,",
      "start": 200.0,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 204.04
    },
    {
      "text": "the US made a major agreement with Saudi",
      "start": 201.68,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 205.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Arabia,",
      "start": 204.04,
      "duration": 2.68,
      "end": 206.72
    },
    {
      "text": "one of the world's largest oil",
      "start": 205.32,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 208.48
    },
    {
      "text": "producers.",
      "start": 206.72,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 210.04
    },
    {
      "text": "The deal was simple. [music]",
      "start": 208.48,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 212.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Saudi Arabia would sell its oil only in",
      "start": 210.04,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 214.08
    },
    {
      "text": "US dollars.",
      "start": 212.44,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 217.0
    },
    {
      "text": "In return, the US would provide military",
      "start": 214.08,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 218.88
    },
    {
      "text": "protection and support.",
      "start": 217.0,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 221.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Since Saudi Arabia was the largest of",
      "start": 218.88,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 223.2
    },
    {
      "text": "the oil producing countries,",
      "start": 221.08,
      "duration": 5.28,
      "end": 226.36
    },
    {
      "text": "the other ones soon had to follow suit.",
      "start": 223.2,
      "duration": 5.36,
      "end": 228.56
    },
    {
      "text": "This meant that you needed US dollars if",
      "start": 226.36,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 230.36
    },
    {
      "text": "you wanted to buy oil from most major",
      "start": 228.56,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 231.72
    },
    {
      "text": "producers,",
      "start": 230.36,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 234.2
    },
    {
      "text": "no matter where you were in the world,",
      "start": 231.72,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 236.2
    },
    {
      "text": "this system is what we call the",
      "start": 234.2,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 238.16
    },
    {
      "text": "petrodollar system.",
      "start": 236.2,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "end": 239.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Now,",
      "start": 238.16,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "end": 241.12
    },
    {
      "text": "here's the big idea.",
      "start": 239.24,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 243.28
    },
    {
      "text": "If every country needs oil,",
      "start": 241.12,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 245.48
    },
    {
      "text": "and oil is sold in dollars,",
      "start": 243.28,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 248.12
    },
    {
      "text": "then every country needs dollars.",
      "start": 245.48,
      "duration": 5.24,
      "end": 250.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Imagine you're a country like Japan.",
      "start": 248.12,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 252.8
    },
    {
      "text": "You don't produce much oil,",
      "start": 250.72,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 255.4
    },
    {
      "text": "but you need oil to power your economy.",
      "start": 252.8,
      "duration": 5.44,
      "end": 258.24
    },
    {
      "text": "To buy oil, you must first get US",
      "start": 255.4,
      "duration": 5.92,
      "end": 261.32
    },
    {
      "text": "dollars, second, keep dollar reserves",
      "start": 258.24,
      "duration": 6.6,
      "end": 264.84
    },
    {
      "text": "ready, third, trade with the US or hold",
      "start": 261.32,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "end": 266.64
    },
    {
      "text": "US assets.",
      "start": 264.84,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 269.28
    },
    {
      "text": "This creates constant global demand for",
      "start": 266.64,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 270.72
    },
    {
      "text": "the US dollar.",
      "start": 269.28,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 272.84
    },
    {
      "text": "And that demand gives the US major",
      "start": 270.72,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 274.44
    },
    {
      "text": "advantages.",
      "start": 272.84,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 276.0
    },
    {
      "text": "It keeps the dollar strong because",
      "start": 274.44,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 277.8
    },
    {
      "text": "everyone needs dollars.",
      "start": 276.0,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 279.64
    },
    {
      "text": "It allows the US government to borrow",
      "start": 277.8,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 281.64
    },
    {
      "text": "money more easily and at lower interest",
      "start": 279.64,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "end": 282.84
    },
    {
      "text": "rates.",
      "start": 281.64,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 285.36
    },
    {
      "text": "And it means the US can use financial",
      "start": 282.84,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 287.72
    },
    {
      "text": "systems like sanctions to influence",
      "start": 285.36,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 289.76
    },
    {
      "text": "other countries because so many",
      "start": 287.72,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 292.52
    },
    {
      "text": "international transactions go through US",
      "start": 289.76,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 293.76
    },
    {
      "text": "banks.",
      "start": 292.52,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "end": 295.48
    },
    {
      "text": "In simple terms,",
      "start": 293.76,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 298.2
    },
    {
      "text": "the petrodollar helps keep the US dollar",
      "start": 295.48,
      "duration": 5.8,
      "end": 301.28
    },
    {
      "text": "at the center of the world economy.",
      "start": 298.2,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 303.08
    },
    {
      "text": "What happens to the oil money that the",
      "start": 301.28,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 305.4
    },
    {
      "text": "oil-producing countries receive? They",
      "start": 303.08,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 307.84
    },
    {
      "text": "don't just store piles of cash. They",
      "start": 305.4,
      "duration": 5.56,
      "end": 310.96
    },
    {
      "text": "invest it. This is called petrodollar",
      "start": 307.84,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 312.28
    },
    {
      "text": "recycling.",
      "start": 310.96,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 315.24
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, oil countries invest in US",
      "start": 312.28,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 317.0
    },
    {
      "text": "government bonds.",
      "start": 315.24,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 319.12
    },
    {
      "text": "They buy American companies.",
      "start": 317.0,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 321.12
    },
    {
      "text": "They invest in real estate and global",
      "start": 319.12,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 322.44
    },
    {
      "text": "markets.",
      "start": 321.12,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 324.88
    },
    {
      "text": "This means the dollars often flow back",
      "start": 322.44,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 327.28
    },
    {
      "text": "into the US financial system. It becomes",
      "start": 324.88,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 328.4
    },
    {
      "text": "a loop.",
      "start": 327.28,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 331.44
    },
    {
      "text": "First, countries buy oil with dollars.",
      "start": 328.4,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "end": 334.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Second, oil producers earn dollars.",
      "start": 331.44,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "end": 337.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Third, oil producers invest those",
      "start": 334.8,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "end": 340.0
    },
    {
      "text": "dollars back into US assets. And",
      "start": 337.44,
      "duration": 6.36,
      "end": 343.8
    },
    {
      "text": "fourthly, the dollar stays strong.",
      "start": 340.0,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 344.88
    },
    {
      "text": "So,",
      "start": 343.8,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "end": 346.64
    },
    {
      "text": "what's the future of the petrodollar",
      "start": 344.88,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 348.24
    },
    {
      "text": "system?",
      "start": 346.64,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 350.44
    },
    {
      "text": "In recent years, some countries like",
      "start": 348.24,
      "duration": 5.28,
      "end": 353.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Russia, Venezuela, India, and Pakistan",
      "start": 350.44,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 354.92
    },
    {
      "text": "have tried to trade oil in other",
      "start": 353.52,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 357.32
    },
    {
      "text": "currencies like the euro or the Chinese",
      "start": 354.92,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 358.6
    },
    {
      "text": "yuan.",
      "start": 357.32,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "end": 360.24
    },
    {
      "text": "This is one of the goals of the BRICS",
      "start": 358.6,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 362.32
    },
    {
      "text": "trade alliance, which is a partnership",
      "start": 360.24,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 365.0
    },
    {
      "text": "of countries that aims to reduce global",
      "start": 362.32,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 367.08
    },
    {
      "text": "dependence on the dollar.",
      "start": 365.0,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "end": 368.2
    },
    {
      "text": "So,",
      "start": 367.08,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 370.48
    },
    {
      "text": "here's the million-dollar question. Why",
      "start": 368.2,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 372.48
    },
    {
      "text": "are countries that are hostile to the US",
      "start": 370.48,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "end": 375.4
    },
    {
      "text": "still trading oil in dollars?",
      "start": 372.48,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "end": 377.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Moving away from the petrodollar system",
      "start": 375.4,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "end": 380.32
    },
    {
      "text": "isn't as simple as it sounds.",
      "start": 377.88,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 382.68
    },
    {
      "text": "If you suddenly switch currencies,",
      "start": 380.32,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 384.96
    },
    {
      "text": "you're not just changing payments,",
      "start": 382.68,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 387.04
    },
    {
      "text": "you're disrupting contracts, hedging",
      "start": 384.96,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "end": 390.56
    },
    {
      "text": "systems, insurance, and pricing models.",
      "start": 387.04,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "end": 392.64
    },
    {
      "text": "The US dollar offers high liquidity,",
      "start": 390.56,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 394.36
    },
    {
      "text": "meaning that you can move billions",
      "start": 392.64,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 396.4
    },
    {
      "text": "without crashing the market,",
      "start": 394.36,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 399.04
    },
    {
      "text": "and it has strong legal protections.",
      "start": 396.4,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 400.76
    },
    {
      "text": "It's like when Facebook tried to",
      "start": 399.04,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 402.64
    },
    {
      "text": "introduce Threads to compete with",
      "start": 400.76,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 403.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Twitter.",
      "start": 402.64,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "end": 405.64
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not so easy to suddenly get",
      "start": 403.92,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 407.76
    },
    {
      "text": "everyone to move platform when",
      "start": 405.64,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 409.08
    },
    {
      "text": "everything's already happening on",
      "start": 407.76,
      "duration": 2.56,
      "end": 410.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Twitter.",
      "start": 409.08,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 412.4
    },
    {
      "text": "But China and Russia are reducing their",
      "start": 410.32,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 415.36
    },
    {
      "text": "dollar use selectively.",
      "start": 412.4,
      "duration": 5.52,
      "end": 417.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Recently, Russia has increased oil trade",
      "start": 415.36,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 419.8
    },
    {
      "text": "with China in yuan.",
      "start": 417.92,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 421.6
    },
    {
      "text": "It's settled some of its transactions in",
      "start": 419.8,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "end": 422.8
    },
    {
      "text": "rubles,",
      "start": 421.6,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 424.76
    },
    {
      "text": "and it's reduced its US Treasury",
      "start": 422.8,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 426.56
    },
    {
      "text": "holdings.",
      "start": 424.76,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 429.72
    },
    {
      "text": "China now promotes yuan-denominated oil",
      "start": 426.56,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 431.12
    },
    {
      "text": "contracts,",
      "start": 429.72,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 433.36
    },
    {
      "text": "and it encourages trade settlements in",
      "start": 431.12,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "end": 434.32
    },
    {
      "text": "yuan [music]",
      "start": 433.36,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 436.84
    },
    {
      "text": "with its trading partners. But, here's",
      "start": 434.32,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 439.32
    },
    {
      "text": "the key. They reduce dollar use where",
      "start": 436.84,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 441.24
    },
    {
      "text": "it's politically necessary,",
      "start": 439.32,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 443.64
    },
    {
      "text": "especially under sanctions, while still",
      "start": 441.24,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 445.44
    },
    {
      "text": "using it when it's convenient and",
      "start": 443.64,
      "duration": 3.28,
      "end": 446.92
    },
    {
      "text": "efficient.",
      "start": 445.44,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "end": 450.36
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a gradual shift, not a revolution.",
      "start": 446.92,
      "duration": 5.84,
      "end": 452.76
    },
    {
      "text": "But China's strategy to destabilize the",
      "start": 450.36,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 454.0
    },
    {
      "text": "dollar",
      "start": 452.76,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 455.92
    },
    {
      "text": "isn't just limited to the petrodollar",
      "start": 454.0,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 457.16
    },
    {
      "text": "system. [music]",
      "start": 455.92,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 459.88
    },
    {
      "text": "It's also using the gold market.",
      "start": 457.16,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "end": 462.08
    },
    {
      "text": "You You watch our video just to the left",
      "start": 459.88,
      "duration": 5.24,
      "end": 465.12
    },
    {
      "text": "of me, here, to understand how China is",
      "start": 462.08,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 466.96
    },
    {
      "text": "using the gold market to break the",
      "start": 465.12,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 469.84
    },
    {
      "text": "global financial grip of the US dollar",
      "start": 466.96,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 471.64
    },
    {
      "text": "and how it's causing gold prices to",
      "start": 469.84,
      "duration": 5.68,
      "end": 475.52
    },
    {
      "text": "surge to unprecedented levels.",
      "start": 471.64,
      "duration": 5.64,
      "end": 477.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks for watching. See you all in the",
      "start": 475.52,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 479.92
    },
    {
      "text": "next one.",
      "start": 477.28,
      "duration": 2.64,
      "end": 479.92
    }
  ]
}